  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A famous action movie star from Yan, FEater was forced to give up her film career after contracting Oripathy. She found a new purpose in life at Rhodes Island.",
        "zh": "原炎国著名武打电影明星，因矿石病而不得不放弃了电影拍摄。其后来到了罗德岛，一度丢失了人生目标的食铁兽找到了新的目标。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests for this Operator showed blurry outlines of internal organs with visible dark spots. Unusually high concentrations of Originium particles were present in her circulatory system, indicating infection and confirming her as Infected at this stage.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 7.2% \nVisible traces of Originium on the subject's right leg, but it has not yet crystallized. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.21u/L \nFEater's infection is still in early stages and has yet to substantially impact her health.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】7.2%\n右腿有明显的源石痕迹但尚未结晶。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.21 u/L\n感染程度尚浅，暂时还没有带来明显身体影响。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "FEater studied martial arts for many years prior to entering the film industry. She is the heir to the Tie Yi Liu He Quan, the Universal Fist of the Iron Will, one of Yan's great martial arts traditions. FEater has mastered all Five Elements, Eight Strikes, and Twelve Forms of her art, giving her the ability to deal devastating blows in the blink of an eye.",
        "zh": "从影之前的食铁兽就接受了多年的武术训练。身为炎国铁意六合拳法传人，精通全套五行八攻十二式，转瞬间即可造成巨大的攻击威力。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "After contracting Oripathy, FEater's acting career and aspirations came to a screeching halt. But she didn't give into depression like one might expect, since movies to her were just one vehicle for delivering righteousness. The optimistic former star quickly landed back on her feet.",
        "zh": "感染了矿石病之后，食铁兽的事业和梦想就这样化为了泡影。但是她并没有想周围的人想的一样沉沦，对食铁兽来说，电影也仅仅只是自己发扬正义之心的一个手段而已。乐观豁达的她马上为自己找到了接下来的路。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Even after becoming a movie star, even having been a legendary martial arts master, FEater has always been someone very approachable. In fact, she is actually rather naive and gets along easily with other Operators. Her hobbies include movies, of course, as well as Yan food, and chugging alcohol with a friendly crowd.",
        "zh": "武打演员的名气和高深的拳术修为并没有让食铁兽变成一个高傲冷漠不宜接近的人，反而略有一些傻气的她很轻易地便和其他干员打成一片。闲暇时间的食铁兽喜欢电影，喜欢炎国美食，喜欢和其他人在酒场豪饮。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    }
  ]
}
